==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Medama-Oyaji (Enemy)|Medama-Oyaji]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
**1 [[Le'boin]] spawns.

==Strategy==
A pretty easy stage to beat, using ranged attackers like [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] can be used to deal with Le'boin while other units with high DPS can be used for the remaining enemies.

==Trivia==
*The name of this stage referred to the [https://seesaawiki.jp/urugege/d/%C9%B4%B5%B4%CC%EB%B9%D4 Hyakki Yagyō] feature in [[Yuru-i GeGeGe no Kitarou: Youkai Dotabata Daisensou|YuruGeGe]], which would summon a parade of [[wikia:gegegenokitaro:Yōkai|yōkai]] to block and push back enemies, including [[wikia:gegegenokitaro:Chōchin-Obake|Chōchin-Obake]], [[wikia:gegegenokitaro:Kasa-Bake|Kasa-Bake]], [[wikia:gegegenokitaro:Yagyō-san|Yagyō-san]], [[wikia:gegegenokitaro:Gyūki|Gyūki]], [[wikia:gegegenokitaro:Rokuro-Kubi|Rokuro-Kubi]], a cat-like yōkai, a fox-like yōkai and a yōkai with a [[wikia:gegegenokitaro:Tengu|Tengu]]-like nose.

